        "maxRank": 5,
        "summary": "Katarina blinks to the target, striking it if its an enemy, or striking the nearest enemy otherwise.",
        "bodyHtml": "Katarina blinks in the wink of an eye to the target ally, enemy, or <span class=\"text-yellow-600 dark:text-yellow-400 font-semibold\">Dagger</span>. If it is an enemy, Katarina strikes for <span class=\"text-blue-600 dark:text-blue-500 font-semibold\">(20/30/40/50/60 + (25% Ability Power) + (40% Attack Damage)) magic damage</span> - otherwise she strikes the nearest enemy in range.<br /><br />Picking up a <span class=\"text-yellow-600 dark:text-yellow-400 font-semibold\">Dagger</span> will reduce this Ability's Cooldown by <span class=\"text-gray-600 dark:text-gray-400\">1</span> seconds (<span class=\"text-gray-600 dark:text-gray-400\">100%</span>). Katarina can blink to any location near the target.<br /><br /><span class=\"text-gray-600 dark:text-gray-400 italic\">The strike Applies On-Hit Effects.</span>",
