        "maxRank": 3,
        "summary": "Katarina becomes a flurry of blades, dealing massive magic damage while she channels to the 3 nearest enemy champions.",
        "bodyHtml": "Katarina becomes a flurry of blades, rapidly attacking the three nearest enemy champions with a flurry of knives. Each knife deals <span class=\"text-blue-600 dark:text-blue-500 font-semibold\">(25/37.5/50 + (19% Ability Power)) magic damage</span> and <span class=\"text-red-600 dark:text-red-500 font-semibold\"> physical damage</span>, and applies 40% Grievous Wounds for 3 seconds.<br /><br />Total over 2.5 seconds to each enemy: <span class=\"text-blue-600 dark:text-blue-500 font-semibold\">(25/37.5/50 + (19% Ability Power)) magic damage</span> and <span class=\"text-red-600 dark:text-red-500 font-semibold\"> physical damage</span>.<br /><br /><span class=\"text-gray-600 dark:text-gray-400 italic\">This Ability applies <span>On-Hit and On-Attack</span> effects at 25/30/35% damage, and does not Critically Strike or apply Life Steal.<br />The <span class=\"text-red-600 dark:text-red-500 font-semibold\">physical damage</span> additionally increases with <span>Attack Speed</span>.</span>",
